--- !u!114 &1230696552
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1230696549}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Yo, Storm! What\u2019s smokin\u2019\r\n"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "Well, I set my QUEST to get here. And now I\u2019m here. I feel so accomplished."
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: "I\u2019m sure there are a TON of quests more legit than that\u2026\r\n"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "Where\u2019s the rest of the S.A.F.E. club?\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "They\u2019re all just hangin\u2019 around. Thad is training, Big Sam is
      selling some crap in the other room. Stretch is busy worrying about nothing\u2026 "
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Have you seen Spartan Jack anywhere?

'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Come to think of it.. Nope. He\u2019s probably sick or something.\r"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: "\u2026 Something\u2019s wrong, isn\u2019t it.\r\n"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "What? No! Everything\u2019s fine. Copacetic. Peachy f\u2014\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: "I have E-S-Pow too, you know. And it doesn\u2019t take a detective to
      know when you look worried. Is it about Jack?\r\n"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "No, it\u2019s\u2026 Look, if it was anything serious, I would talk it
      out with Sensei. It\u2019s probably just nothing\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: "Well I know something that can get your mind off.. whatever it is\u2026
      in a snap! You should get together with a SQUAD and go on some Quests!\r\n"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "I\u2026 Didn\u2019t know I could do that. A SQUAD?\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Y\u2019know.. a party? Of people? A group of friends?\r\n"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "I\u2019m kidding, dorktimus prime.\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Embarrassed
  - text: "\u2026\r\n"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Embarrassed
  - text: "Explain it to me anyway, just for fun. I\u2019m bored.\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: Well, all you gotta do is ask around. You can recruit up to 3 people in
      your SQUAD, and you're one of them. If you regret everything, come back here
      and push the big button and it'll RESET your squad.
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: Gather your SQUAD and meet me outside! We've got some QUESTS to do
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: You think that if anything can take your mind off of Spartan Jack and Jade,
      it would be getting out of this place.
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: 'You can even...

      ask ME to join...

      y''know, if you want to'
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1230696548}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Dissapointed
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
