--- !u!114 &1324303869
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1324303863}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Sensei: Welcome back to YOU-JITSU! And I see you\u2019re here too, Spartan
      Jack. Just in time!\r"
    name: Sensei
    character: {fileID: 1980157446}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: 
  - text: I will now show you what YOU JUTSU is all about
    name: Sensei
    character: {fileID: 1980157446}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Happy
  - text: "Umm.. Let me guess\u2026 Is it about YOU?"
    name: Witch Doctor
    character: {fileID: 2052237946}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "Not me\u2026 YOU! I can see how that could get a bit confusing\u2026 But
      if I named it ME-JITSU\u2026 Well\u2026 Let\u2019s just set that aside for
      now."
    name: Sensei
    character: {fileID: 1980157446}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  - text: "Lesson one. You have MP. This stands for \u2018MURICA POINTS. Each time
      you perform a JAPANESE technique, you become less \u2018MURICAN. And so your
      MP drops."
    name: Sensei
    character: {fileID: 1980157446}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  - text: ' Uhh.. Sensei?'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 988034513}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'NO TIME FOR QUESTIONS! Lesson two: TP! TP stands for TERRROR POINTS. The
      more you BEAT THE $@&* out of your enemies, the more TERROR POINTS you earn.
      Build up enough and you can perform high powered attacks.'
    name: Sensei
    character: {fileID: 1980157446}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Angry
  - text: 'Final lesson: When an enemy ATTACKS, you get to DODGE with WASD. (Duck
      under YELLOW attacks, sidestep GREEN attacks, and jump over BLUE attacks) Time
      it perfectly and you get to COUNTERATTACK.'
    name: Sensei
    character: {fileID: 1980157446}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  - text: "Now that we got the basics out of the way\u2026 It\u2019s time to try
      it out. Spartan Jack, you\u2019re partners with Big Sam"
    name: Sensei
    character: {fileID: 1980157446}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: 'Yusss...

      SHOW ME WHAT YOU GOT, BIG BOY'
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 642400227}
    pose: Objection
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Happy
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
