--- !u!114 &2049534178
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2049534176}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: I jumped like fifty feet in the air, flipping every which way, sword above
      my head, and then, WHACK! Shattered it into a million pieces with my brute
      strength
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 343813143}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "So, yeah, that\u2019s how it happened. Crazy, right?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 343813143}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "Now THAT\u2019s a true warrior! I always knew you were a real one.. Not
      that I.. had my doubts or anything"
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 318650398}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: Sayonara, Khan. A-plus work, Spartan
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1801288290}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "My dad\u2019s so gonna kill me"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 587505749}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "No he won\u2019t - no sword, none of his powers, remember?"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 2000921898}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Happy
  - text: Oh yeah! And no DOJOPLEX? Finally, I can get some REST!
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 587505749}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: What am I gonna say to my mom about all this... Going back home tonight
      is gonna be... interesting
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 343813143}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "You did the right thing\u2026 You do realize she was absolutely psychotic,
      right? And until you figure your life out, there\u2019s always room to sleep
      in the TorchCave(\u2122)"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1723888408}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: We've got your back, soldier. All of us.
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 2000921898}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: I say the hero who didn't end the world should lead the S.A.F.E. club,
      whaddaya say, Storm?
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1801288290}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Happy
  - text: 'Reasonable...

      Anyone but me. Ugh. I was starting to feel like a
      villain.'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 587505749}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: So... What now, President Spartan?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 587505749}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: May I suggest... A PARTY?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 318650398}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
